  "title": "The BMI-HDEEG dataset 4",
  "description": "A high-density scalp electroencephalogram (HD-EEG) dataset acquired during sensorimotor rhythm-based brain-computer interface (BCI) tasks. This dataset comprises recordings from multiple subjects performing motor imagery and related sensorimotor tasks, designed to support the development and validation of BCI systems. The HD-EEG recordings provide detailed spatial resolution of cortical activity relevant to motor control and brain-computer interfacing research.",
